# [DD-13b.W23.1] A `config` BODY MIXING A 2-SPACE LINE AND A TAB LINE.
# §1.6.1a narrowing (4)'s sharper half: this parses FLAT at rc 0 on the
# pre-W23 binary, and it has NO DEFINED TREE under any depth rule — two
# spellings of indentation with no agreed depth between them. That is why
# the tab rule is not cosmetic.
config dev
  flags i
	engine vm

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
